    "guide.ch-1.title": "What forest-based therapy is",
    "guide.ch-1.desc": "Definitional boundaries. Distinguishing FBT from forest bathing, wilderness therapy, and general outdoor work. The therapeutic contract in a natural setting.",
    "guide.ch-2.title": "Theoretical foundations",
    "guide.ch-2.desc": "Attention Restoration Theory, Stress Recovery Theory, biophilia, phytoncides. What the mechanisms imply for practice.",
    "guide.ch-3.title": "Evidence base",
